{"id":"u-2f76e49f-de4f-41e4-9511-bb05ff05817d","src":"community","title":"Aesthetic Iron: Hypertrophy & Strength Split","author":"Jason R.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/KMNAA9-531-slightly-less-boring-but-big-1","desc":"Designed for experienced lifters looking to maximize muscle growth and build absolute strength, Aesthetic Iron combines intelligent volume periodization with targeted muscle prioritization.Over 12 weeks, this 5-day split shifts from high-stress metabolic hypertrophy to heavy mechanical tension, helping you break through plateaus without burnout.\n\nWhat to Expect:\nWeeks 1–6 (Volume Phase): High volume, higher-rep ranges (8–15 reps) engineered to drive metabolic stress, cellular swelling, and maximum hypertrophy.\n\nWeeks 7–12 (Strength Phase): Lower rep, heavy compound work (4–8 reps) designed to build raw strength while maintaining high isolation volume.\n\nAesthetic Focus: Dedicated frequency and volume for upper chest, lateral delts, arms, and lats to build a wide, V-taper physique.\n\nSpecialized Lower Days: Two distinct leg workouts one Quad dominant, one Glute/Posterior dominant to ensure balanced, full-leg development.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-11T11:59:41.297Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper: Chest & Lat Focus","Lower: Quad Focus","Upper: Delts, Upper Back & Arm","Lower: Glute Focus","Chest, Shoulders & Arms"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Neutral Grip)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi